%% UC-07 — Request personalised recommendations (full M3 pipeline)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Participant
    participant F as Flutter App
    participant B as Backend (recommendRouter)
    participant AI as API-service (FastAPI)
    participant R as Redis
    participant N as Neo4j
    participant MB as Backend (service token)
    participant LR as LightRAG
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant M as MongoDB

    P->>F: Enter health goal
    F->>B: POST /api/v1/recommend/generate {goal, session_id}
    B->>AI: POST /api/v1/llm/recommend {user_id, goal, session_id}
    AI->>R: GET cache(sha256(user_id‖goal))

    alt cache hit
        R-->>AI: cached recommendations
    else cache miss

        par M3.1 — extract-habits
            Note over AI,N: embed goal once, reuse for both searches
            AI->>N: MATCH Habit {userID} — fetch embeddings (≤200 rows)
            N-->>AI: habit nodes + stored vectors
            Note over AI: cosine rank in Python → top USER_HABITS_LIMIT personal habits
            AI->>N: vector search habit_embedding_idx (community, excl. user)
            AI->>N: vector search context_embedding_idx (community, excl. user)
            AI->>N: vector search bcio_embedding_idx (community, excl. user)
            N-->>AI: top-k per index, merged by max score
            Note over AI: dedup personal + community → candidate pool ≤20 habits
            AI->>LLM: select habits from candidate pool
            LLM-->>AI: selected_habit_uuids + habit_summary

        and M3.2 — extract-profile
            AI->>MB: GET /questionnaire-responses/service/{userId}/sliq
            MB-->>AI: SLIQ answers (or 404)
            AI->>MB: GET /questionnaire-responses/service/{userId}/rand-36
            MB-->>AI: RAND-36 answers (or 404)
            AI->>MB: GET /user-profile/service/{userId}
            MB-->>AI: profile fields
            AI->>LLM: build profile summary + rag_query
            LLM-->>AI: profile_summary, profile_detailed, rag_query
        end

        AI->>LR: POST /query {query: rag_query, mode: hybrid}
        LR-->>AI: synthesized KB context (graph + vector sources)

        AI->>M: find recommendation_feedback {userId, goal} limit 10
        M-->>AI: prior feedback comments

        Note over AI,LLM: prompt = goal + profile + habit_summary + selected_habits + community_habits + KB sources + feedback
        AI->>LLM: POST /chat/completions (recommend.txt prompt, temp 0.2)
        LLM-->>AI: recommendations JSON

        AI->>M: insert recommendations
        AI->>R: SETEX cache TTL 24h
    end

    AI-->>B: {recommendation_id, recommendations}
    B-->>F: 200 OK
    F->>F: Render recommendation cards
